UID:2026-11-11-c@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T222935Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261111
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261112
SUMMARY:Kracht: Lower A zonder squat/RDL
DESCRIPTION:Leg press i.p.v. squat\; geen RDL deze week.\nLeg press 3×8
 –10 @RIR2\nBulgarian split squat (per been\, dumbbells totaal) 3×8 @RIR
 3\nHamstring curl 2×10–12 @RIR2\nStaande calf raise 3×10–15 @RIR1\nT
 ibialis raise 2×15–20 @RIR1\nCopenhagen plank (sec per kant) 2×20–30
  @RIR2\nDead bug (per kant) 2×8 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
