DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
SUMMARY:Lopen: Easy 7–8 km + 6 strides
DESCRIPTION:HF ≤ 145 · ~5:40–6:00/km · RPE 2–3\n6 × 20 s strides\
