UID:2026-11-19-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T222935Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Kracht: Upper B + core
DESCRIPTION:Pull-up (+ extra kg) 4×5–8 @RIR2\nShoulder press (staand/zi
